# 14. Keep-Alive (Persistent Connections)

Without Keep-Alive

```
Open TCP

↓

Request

↓

Close
```

Every request creates a new TCP connection.

With Keep-Alive

```
Open TCP

↓

Multiple Requests

↓

Multiple Responses

↓

Close
```

Reduces latency and improves performance.

